00:12:40.738 --> 00:12:45.033
On a weakness that I'd like
have more of a strength on,

00:12:45.033 --> 00:12:47.436
I'd like to remember
people's names better.

00:12:47.436 --> 00:12:49.051
Actually that's very easy.

00:12:49.051 --> 00:12:50.373
I spend an enormous amount of time

00:12:50.373 --> 00:12:51.720
in our HR software trying to make sure

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.253
I know everybody's names.

00:12:53.253 --> 00:12:55.157
And then the answer really is,

00:12:55.157 --> 00:12:57.269
I have to listen a little bit better

00:12:57.269 --> 00:12:59.069
