00:12:59.069 --> 00:13:01.910
Like I'm like, hey, I'm Gary.

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.517
You need to say, "Hi, I'm India."

00:13:03.517 --> 00:13:04.652
- My name's India.

00:13:04.652 --> 00:13:06.629
