00:13:13.153 --> 00:13:15.092
So like not listening
when people say hello

00:13:15.092 --> 00:13:17.134
is a weakness because
if I actually listen,

00:13:17.134 --> 00:13:19.573
I'll have a 50% chance of
remembering their name.

00:13:19.573 --> 00:13:21.546
It's crazy, I will remember everything.

00:13:21.546 --> 00:13:23.902
I'm very visual, like
I can never get lost,

00:13:23.902 --> 00:13:25.726
I'm killer on directions.

00:13:25.726 --> 00:13:28.232
I will bring up stuff
that happened between us

00:13:28.232 --> 00:13:30.612
like 15 years from now,
you'll be like, "What?"

00:13:30.612 --> 00:13:33.190
If I see it, it's on.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.184
But if I hear it, it's
on, but I need to listen

00:13:36.184 --> 00:13:37.903
in the first place to remember your name.

00:13:37.903 --> 00:13:41.130
So remembering names is
something I'm passionately

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.650
upset with myself about,
like, Doc, you could see,

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.066
I knew Sheldon right away.

00:13:45.066 --> 00:13:50.066
Visually I know his profile
side face, like hair, glasses,

00:13:50.267 --> 00:13:53.226
